      "content": "thanks for the tip, but i'm pretty sure the code is writing to a path, not the root. the logs show it's trying to hit `prod-logs-storage-99/logs/daily/file.log`. \n\ni also checked the bucket policy and it doesn't have any weird conditions or restrictions. is there anything else that could be silently blocking it? it feels like something is just sneaking in and stopping the request right at the gate.",
